{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99705","id":2200630561,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DKvUh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99705/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99705/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f5d2abeb3e02a2773f46b7443c8318c7f5101088","number":99705,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Enable Godot reinstantiation on iOS for embedding in a single view","user":{"login":"louis-prudhomme","id":29575473,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTc1NDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29575473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme","html_url":"https://github.com/louis-prudhomme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louis-prudhomme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Partially adresses : https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1473.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to be able to run Godot from within a classically-made mobile app (think Snapchat Games). As underlined in the umbrella issue, several things will still be missing after this PR is merged :\r\n1. **boot splashscreen management** : a way to enable / disable the boot splashscreen at will\r\n2. **export configuration** : supporting project export as either an embeddable or a full-fledged standalone app\r\n\r\nWe faced many issues related to instanciating Godot several times. We fixed all of them, but are unsure for some fixes ; specificially, we came up using a queue to store `StringName` references. We are iOS developers and we're humble about our C++ knowledge, but we're committed to make this work ; any feedback is therefore much appreciated.\r\n\r\nWhile the ability to embed Godot is functional with this PR, some manual adjustments are still required. An example implementation demonstrating how to embed Godot in a basic mobile app is available in our repository: [here](https://github.com/bamlab/EmbeddableGodot).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_